# cluster.example — copy to input/cluster and name the doors.
#
# The porch speaks to the orchestrator: one line per door,
#   name host port
# What stands behind each door — three little minds, one split
# model, something stranger — is the orchestrator's business.
# One door is enough; the porch will ask it for three readings.
#
# orchestrator 192.168.1.40 8080
